#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Field Behavior Settings"
msgstr "Veld Gedrag Instellings"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Visibility Control"
msgstr "Aktiveer Veld Sigbaarheid Beheer"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Show/hide fields based on content type selection. Controls URL, date, and published fields visibility."
msgstr "Wys/versteek velde gebaseer op inhoudsoorte keuse. Beheer URL, datum en gepubliseerde velde sigbaarheid."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Additional Tags"
msgstr "Aktiveer Bykomende Velde"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Add content-type specific additional tags (event statuses, project statuses, etc.) based on thesaurus content type."
msgstr "Voeg inhoudsoorte-spesifieke bykomende velde by (gebeurtenis statusse, projek statusse, ens.) gebaseer op tesaurus inhoudsoorte."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Auto Summary"
msgstr "Aktiveer Outomatiese Opsomming"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically generate summary from body content as user types."
msgstr "Genereer outomaties opsomming van liggaam inhoud soos gebruiker tik."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Help Comments"
msgstr "Aktiveer Veld Hulp Kommentare"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Display contextual help comments for fields based on content type."
msgstr "Wys kontekstuele hulp kommentare vir velde gebaseer op inhoudsoorte."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Field Visibility Rules"
msgstr "Veld Sigbaarheid Reëls"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Define custom field visibility rules (JSON format)."
msgstr "Definieer aangepaste veld sigbaarheid reëls (JSON formaat)."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Translation Defaults"
msgstr "Vertaling Verstekwaardes"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Configure creation of translation defaults (language placeholders) for translatable entities."
msgstr "Konfigureer skep van vertaling verstekwaardes (taal plekhouers) vir vertaalbare entiteite."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically create translation defaults"
msgstr "Skep outomaties vertaling verstekwaardes"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translation defaults (placeholders) are created for other languages at entity create/update. Existing translations with proper source are not overwritten."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, word vertaling verstekwaardes (plekhouers) geskep vir ander tale by entiteit skep/opdatering. Bestaande vertalings met behoorlike bron word nie oorskryf nie."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Use all available languages"
msgstr "Gebruik alle beskikbare tale"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translations will be created for all languages installed on the site. When disabled, only the selected target languages below will be used."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal vertalings geskep word vir alle tale wat op die werf geïnstalleer is. Wanneer gedeaktiveer, sal slegs die gekose teikentale hieronder gebruik word."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Target languages for translation defaults"
msgstr "Teikentale vir vertaling verstekwaardes"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which languages to create translation defaults for. Used only when \"Use all available languages\" is disabled."
msgstr "Kies watter tale om vertaling verstekwaardes vir te skep. Gebruik slegs wanneer \"Gebruik alle beskikbare tale\" gedeaktiveer is."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Copy source field values"
msgstr "Kopieer bron veld waardes"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translatable field values from the source language will be copied to new translations."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal vertaalbare veld waardes van die brontaal gekopieer word na nuwe vertalings."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity types"
msgstr "Entiteit tipes"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which entity types should have translation defaults created."
msgstr "Kies watter entiteit tipes vertaling verstekwaardes geskep moet hê."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Batch Operations"
msgstr "Bondel Operasies"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Process existing entities to create missing translation defaults."
msgstr "Prosesseer bestaande entiteite om ontbrekende vertaling verstekwaardes te skep."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity type to process"
msgstr "Entiteit tipe om te prosesseer"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "- Select -"
msgstr "- Kies -"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select an entity type to create translations for existing entities."
msgstr "Kies 'n entiteit tipe om vertalings te skep vir bestaande entiteite."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Create translation defaults for existing entities"
msgstr "Skep vertaling verstekwaardes vir bestaande entiteite"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Please select an entity type to process."
msgstr "Kies asseblief 'n entiteit tipe om te prosesseer."

